{
    "role": "reviewer"
}

### Alterar usuário inexistente
PATCH http://localhost:3000/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/role
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "role": "viewer"
}

### List audit logs
GET http://localhost:3000/audit-logs


#### List audit logs filtered by action
GET http://localhost:3000/audit-logs?action=supplier.created


#### List audit logs filtered by actorUserId
GET http://localhost:3000/audit-logs?page=2&limit=3

